name: Blackboard — spade/club hand X3
author: corpus
description: >-
  Blackboard gives X3 Mult if all cards held in hand after playing are Spades or Clubs
  (or no cards remain). First-shop X3: Checkered Deck, Smeared Joker, and Stuntman help
  empty the hand of Hearts/Diamonds.
deck: Checkered
stake: White
must:
  - joker: Blackboard
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Stuntman
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: MerryAndy
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
